#### recipient — Setup in their Databricks workspace:

- SHOW PROVIDERS; — to see you as a provider
- SHOW SHARES IN PROVIDER <provider_name>; — to see hackathon_share
- CREATE CATALOG hackathon_data USING SHARE <provider_name>.hackathon_share; — to mount the share
- SELECT * FROM hackathon_data.01_bronze.rat_sightings_bronze; — to query the data
